The Copyright Holder may grant additional permissions that supplement the terms of this License.
Additional permissions may remove particular restrictions imposed by this License.
Additional permissions must not be interpreted as removing the fundamental rights granted by this License unless the Copyright Holder expressly states otherwise.
A recipient is not required to accept an additional permission.
Additional permissions may apply to:
particular versions;
particular components;
particular platforms;
particular distributions;
particular uses; or
particular recipients.
