You must preserve reasonable copyright notices contained in the Covered Work.
Modified Works must carry reasonable notices indicating that modifications have been made.
Such notices should identify the person or entity responsible for the modification where reasonably practicable and should include the relevant modification date where reasonably practicable.
You may add additional attribution for your own contributions.
